{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49490","headline":"河传 二 · 顾敻","name":"河传 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曲槛，春晚。\n碧流纹细，绿杨丝輭。\n露华鲜，杏枝繁，鸎转，野芜平似翦。\n直是人间到天上，堪游赏。\n醉眼疑屏障，对池塘。\n惜韶光，断肠，爲花须尽狂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49490.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49490","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}